{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "111", "x": 0.9042195477562772, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.029523700847358492, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "interests or doesn't pay enough. And when you're doing the same thing every", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8259900604107785, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "single day without a sense of progress, it's obviously hard to stay motivated and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8259462822555039, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "satisfied. Also, many people struggle with balancing their job and personal life. I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8261890613461137, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "mean, working long hours can leave you with little time or energy for your family,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8260551637564446, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "hobbies, or even just rest. Over time, that kind of lifestyle can make people feel", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8259030167249982, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "really frustrated or even burnt out.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.3566741899477769, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3412721524535729, "w": 0.025044142118860666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I wouldn't say that having ambitions is always a positive thing. I mean,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.3412721524535729, "w": 0.7658182675476841, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on one hand, ambition pushes people to grow, to achieve more, and to aim higher", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.8260988393867654, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in life. It's definitely a driving force behind success. But on the other hand, if", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39778456980788796, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "someone becomes too obsessed with their goals, they might ignore their health,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4261149576034181, "w": 0.8259461797305501, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "relationships, or even lose sight of what really makes them happy. It can lead to,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4544453076775557, "w": 0.8260117957009852, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you know, a lot of stress and burnout, especially if they're constantly comparing", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48280040298518045, "w": 0.8264256889394952, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "themselves to others. So yeah, ambition can be great, but only if it's balanced with", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5111307907807106, "w": 0.8264147187694381, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "self-care and realistic expectations.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5394611408548482, "w": 0.3697764176817406, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6158493371370579, "w": 0.025648859927639937, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, for me, one of the most important ingredients is having meaningful", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.6158493371370579, "w": 0.765491623044862, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "connections with other people. mean, strong social bonds with family, friends, and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6441796872111956, "w": 0.8266950219931405, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "even the wider community provide a sense of belonging and support that is crucial", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6725471551355638, "w": 0.8260989419117193, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "for our well-being. Feeling connected and having people to share your life with,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7008775052097015, "w": 0.8264783867657509, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you know, that makes a huge difference. Another vital component I would say is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7292079307266242, "w": 0.8268582417195978, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "having a sense of purpose. Well, it doesn't necessarily need to be some grand,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7575382808007618, "w": 0.8259465898303653, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "world-changing goal, but rather feeling like you're contributing something,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7858686308748994, "w": 0.826059674854412, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "whether it's through your work, your hobbies, or your involvement in your", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8141990563918221, "w": 0.8260552662813984, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "community. This feeling of contribution can be incredibly satisfying, and that is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8425294064659596, "w": 0.8260981217120889, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "also what makes life rewarding and meaningful.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8708845017735845, "w": 0.4903502231916982, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}